Save the Draft Outline with write_patent_results, template draft-outline, to drafting/hinge/draft-outline.md; then save the draft with template draft-application, to drafting/hinge/draft-application.md; then call validate_draft. Wrote drafting/hinge/checklist.md: the next step for the attorney is step 3 (Write the draft). Next: Tell the agent: "Draft the application".

