  "Draft Outline was not saved. The content has no Outline Item to save: line 4: draft-outline.md has no Outline table with the columns Item | Section | Kind | Claims | Claim terms | Sources | Explain | Question. Write the plan as one table, one row per Outline Item, and save it again with write_patent_results, template draft-outline. Open in drafting/hinge/checklist.md: step 3 (Write the outline). Next: Tell the agent: "Plan the draft" (it saves draft-outline.md with write_patent_results, template draft-outline).",
  "Draft Outline was not saved. The draft-outline template saves to drafting/<matter>/draft-outline.md inside a workspace folder.",
]
`;

exports[`write_patent_results draft-outline template > writes draft-outline.md with the office of the Feature List and the Approved Claims hash, and reports the outline findings without blocking the save 1`] = `
{
  "boundToClaims": true,
  "frontmatter": "
office: US
claims: <sha>
author: agent
",
