Outline check: 1 Error(s). Fix them in the outline and save it again before drafting:
- \`outline-sources\` (draft-outline.md, line 12): Technical item O3 names no source and no question. Name a Feature List row, a disclosure span, a figure or an answered Inventor Question, or write the open question.
Wrote drafting/hinge/checklist.md: the next step for the attorney is step 3 (Write the draft). Next: Tell the agent: "Draft the application".",
}
`;
